OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof seven counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,7,Fof the attempted murder of seven people
OL,8,Fhe stabbed on a Peterborough-London
OL,9,Ftrain in 2025
OL,11,FWilliams, 33, attacked 10 people in
OL,12,Ftotal on the LNER service on 1 November
OL,13,Flast year
OL,15,FHe denied 14 counts of attempted
OL,16,Fmurder, which includes alleged attacks
OL,17,Faway from the train, in Peterborough
OL,18,Fand London
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
