OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof seven counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury has yet to reach verdicts on
OL,7,Fthe other seven counts of attempted
OL,8,Fmurder, and the judge has asked them to
OL,9,Fcontinue deliberations
OL,11,FMr Justice Calver says he will accept a
OL,12,Fmajority, of 11 or 10 of the 12 jurors,
OL,13,Fon the remaining counts
